WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.472
KeyboardKit 11.3 adds

00:00:02.284 --> 00:00:03.852
experimental in-keyboard

00:00:03.664 --> 00:00:05.078
dictation for iOS

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:05.715
keyboards

00:00:06.246 --> 00:00:08.333
KeyboardKit 11.3 adds

00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:09.724
an experimental dictation

00:00:09.536 --> 00:00:10.656
engine that runs

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:11.540
inside the keyboard

00:00:11.352 --> 00:00:12.154
extension

00:00:12.402 --> 00:00:13.486
using a workaround

00:00:13.298 --> 00:00:14.418
Raycast found

00:00:14.571 --> 00:00:15.939
plus system Shortcuts

00:00:15.751 --> 00:00:16.481
actions

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:18.132
cached keyboard previews

00:00:17.944 --> 00:00:19.724
and simpler localization

00:00:20.254 --> 00:00:21.091
The new .

00:00:20.903 --> 00:00:22.471
inKeyboard engine records

00:00:22.294 --> 00:00:23.261
audio through an

00:00:23.084 --> 00:00:24.275
embedded web view

00:00:24.122 --> 00:00:25.442
and transcribes it

00:00:25.254 --> 00:00:26.055
with the same

00:00:25.867 --> 00:00:27.152
speech recognizer

00:00:27.377 --> 00:00:28.437
avoiding the round

00:00:28.249 --> 00:00:28.909
trip to the

00:00:28.721 --> 00:00:29.428
main app.

00:00:29.966 --> 00:00:30.791
The main app

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:31.463
still has to

00:00:31.275 --> 00:00:32.524
request microphone

00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:33.680
and speech permissions

00:00:33.751 --> 00:00:34.907
and Saidi warns

00:00:34.718 --> 00:00:35.708
Apple could break

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.569
the workaround in

00:00:36.499 --> 00:00:37.808
any iOS update

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:39.348
Full story on

00:00:39.159 --> 00:00:40.055
the dashboard
